<title>UK: RMC results report delayed.</title>
<headline>RMC results report delayed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of the annual results from building materials concern RMC Group Plc due early on Thursday has been delayed by &quot;technical problems,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>The London Stock Exhange said it would &quot;shortly&quot; release a summary of the results and that a full report would be released later in the day.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
